re on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":null},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":null},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":null},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":null},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":null},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":null},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Procedure to follow for players identified as vulnerable persons","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off period","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Operator must offer players option to activate a cooling-off period","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off options","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description":"Options for cooling-off must include duration and marketing opt-out at minimum","notes":null},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-27","description